      "message": "Hi, thx for the patch and sorry for the delay, I was out of office.\nCould we ever be in a case where that condition fails?\nWe know that here, offset[whatever] \u003c code_lengths_size (the equality case is when all the counts are in the same bin, cf line 107).\nAccording to line 256 and 262, BuildHuffmanTable is always called with sorted with a size \u003c\u003d code_lengths_size.",
